    "Orthogonal residual expansion is a Lanczos/Krylov regression arm, not a competing method.",
    "Uncompressed Davidson uses an exact classical sector-statevector preconditioner and is not an implementable hardware primitive.",
    "Packet coefficients and top-K supports are exact-simulation compression diagnostics until a hardware-accessible selection protocol is supplied.",
    "No quantum-advantage, physical-runtime, or shot-cost claim is made by the exact-simulation tier.",
    "The FCIDUMP H4 instance validates construction and is not counted as a distinct physical problem.",
    "CISD and CCSD are chemistry context; only matched-M methods are ranked as compact subspace competitors."
